WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.488
did receive spaghetti noodles, then the first step you're going to do

00:00:03.538 --> 00:00:05.540
is you're going to take all your straws,

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:07.950
take the spaghetti noodles, and you're going to

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.599
like fill them all. So, if you just have a stack of

00:00:10.649 --> 00:00:13.301
straws, and you just like drop spaghetti noodles in,

00:00:13.351 --> 00:00:15.950
it'll start putting them inside, and it should be a

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.236
pretty quick process. If you do not have that,

00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:23.307
don't worry about it. Just go ahead and move to step two.

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:26.950
So, step one is to fill your straws with spaghetti.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.950
The spaghetti noodles that go inside represent the myofilaments.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.674
All right. Um, and they are all bundled inside of a myofibril.

00:00:36.724 --> 00:00:39.950
So, these individual straws are myofibrils.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:40.040
All right. So, if you don't have those,
